# Qwen3.6-35B-A3B MXFP4, 4 x MI455X, MLPerf Endpoints agentic: the 2026-11-25 settings, on top of agentic_20261101.env to
# agentic_20261124.env (README, 2026-11-25 section). Code: alizaidy/gfx1250-qwen-support plus the aiter GDN verify options,
# the grouped-MoE expert lookup, the wide router/shared-expert scheduling, the bucket-512 MoE stage-1 config, the top-k/top-p
# sampling hooks, the ATOM low-concurrency step cuts and the ATOM mixed step. All per point; nothing here changes a point that does not set it.

# --- c256-c1024 (set by the point; measured at c384 and c1024): bitwise ---
#   ATOM_GDN_VERIFY_GROUPED_REPLAY=1 AITER_GDN_VERIFY_LDS_OPT=2 AITER_GDN_VERIFY_TICKET_RELAXED=1
#   AITER_MOE_EXPERT_VEC=1 AITER_ROUTER_SHARED_PREFETCH=1 AITER_ROUTER_SHARED_LATE_USE=1
# 10-minute runs: c1024 172.8 -> 175.6 (+1.6%), c384 450.4 -> 462.4 (+2.7%).

# --- c64: NOT set. The same code at c64 (expert lookup + GDN verify options + the ATOM step cuts below) measured
# 1222.2 -> 1196.2 (-2.1%) in one 10-minute pair; which part costs is not yet known. Left out until it is.
#   (ATOM_MTP_ADVANCE_IN_SELECT ATOM_PRESENCE_IN_SAMPLER ATOM_PROLOGUE_EARLY_PACK ATOM_PROLOGUE_FILL_FUSED ATOM_SKIP_VERIFY_KV_INDICES)

# --- Optional, NUMERICAL: mixed prefill + decode steps (c384-c1024) ---
#   ATOM_MIXED_STEP=1
# Not set: served A/B pending. LLMEngine closed-batch bench (served c384 env, 96 seqs, 600 requests): -0.9% wall
# time (22.27-22.36 vs 22.49-22.57 s); c1024-like (256 seqs) about -1.4%. Numerical: needs the accuracy gate + MTP check.
